  "post_title": "La peña taurina Chicuelina de Onda analiza la Feria de la Magdalena de Castelló",
  "post_date": "2018-03-27 21:50:20",
  "post_name": "la-pena-taurina-chicuelina-de-onda-analiza-la-feria-de-la-magdalena-de-castello",
