  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/ChicuelinaAnalitzaMagdalena2.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(20 fotos) La sede de la Pe&ntilde;a Cultural Taurina Chicuelina de Onda ha acogido este viernes, 23 de marzo, la conferencia resumen de la Feria de la Magdalena de Castell&oacute;n de la Plana, a cargo de Juan Antonio Ribes, asesor de Presidencia de la plaza de toros castellonense, miembro de la Federaci&oacute;n Taurina y del Club Taurino de Castell&oacute;n.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/ChicuelinaAnalitzaMagdalena1.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Durante la charla, seguida de coloquio, se han analizado pormenorizadamente los diferentes festejos, haciendo especial incidencia en la corrida de los Victorinos, que regresaban a Castell&oacute;n tras varios a&ntilde;os.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3568.jpg\" alt=\"img_3568\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3570.jpg\" alt=\"img_3570\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3574.jpg\" alt=\"img_3574\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3575.jpg\" alt=\"img_3575\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3576.jpg\" alt=\"img_3576\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3577.jpg\" alt=\"img_3577\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3580.jpg\" alt=\"img_3580\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3582.jpg\" alt=\"img_3582\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3584.jpg\" alt=\"img_3584\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3591.jpg\" alt=\"img_3591\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3593.jpg\" alt=\"img_3593\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3595.jpg\" alt=\"img_3595\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3598.jpg\" alt=\"img_3598\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3601.jpg\" alt=\"img_3601\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3602.jpg\" alt=\"img_3602\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3606.jpg\" alt=\"img_3606\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3608.jpg\" alt=\"img_3608\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3609.jpg\" alt=\"img_3609\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/charlapenachicuelina/img_3612.jpg\" alt=\"img_3612\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />